{"version":1,"content":"<p>據《連線》（WIRED）報道，隨着人工智能生成內容大量湧現，一場圍繞「小説究竟是不是人寫的」的爭議正在出版業蔓延。在一本恐怖小説被檢測出約78%的內容可能由AI生成、隨後遭出版商撤銷出版計劃後，越來越多的作家開始擔憂：即便作品完全由自己創作，也可能因為文字風格被懷疑使用AI，甚至面臨抵制和聲譽損失。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585724.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.128336+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:22:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"2cdec0552b78445a8998b96fbc725dd594bb730893541923d6a4c9750dc35aa6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}